      "id": "provider-source",
      "statement": "Honeycomb docs \"Authentication\": ingest key ids carry hc[x]ik_, \"The character shown as [x] varies and is assigned at key creation\", and \"The key value is the Key ID and Secret concatenated with no separator\" (58-byte placeholder body); honeycombio/libhoney-go libhoney.go (02e9dbf, 2026-04-14): classicIngestKeyRegex ^hc[a-z]ic_[a-z0-9]*$ applied when len(key) == 64, with 64-byte hcxik_/hcxic_ fixtures; honeycombio/libhoney-py client.py (11b5941): ^hc[a-z]ic_[a-z0-9]{58}$; re-checked 2026-09-29: hc + one [a-z] + ik_ (environment) or ic_ (classic) + exactly 58 [a-z0-9], 64 in all",
      "evidenceClass": "provider-documented",
      "temporality": "current",
      "observedAt": "2026-09-29",
      "sources": [
        {
          "sourceId": "docs-honeycomb-io-542c231450",
          "supports": "hc + one [a-z] + ik_ (environment) or ic_ (classic) + exactly 58 [a-z0-9], 64 in all"
        }
      ]
    },
